# Allowlist: the build context holds only what `go build` needs. Everything
# else stays out, in particular .env / .env.resolved (resolved secrets),
# settings.json, docs/ (review database), .claude/ and local binaries, so
# they never reach the builder or a cached COPY layer, and editing them
# does not invalidate the build cache.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!commands/
!environment/
!internal/
